---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Code of Conduct | Good Corporate Governance | PT Prasetia Dwidharma">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <div class="relative bg-gradient-to-r from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-black text-white py-20 md:py-28 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20">
      <img src="/images/hero/hero2.jpg" alt="Code of Conduct Hero" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
    </div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-gray-950 via-gray-900/80 to-transparent"></div>

    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-600/30 border border-red-500/40 text-red-200 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
        Good Corporate Governance
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">
        Code Of Conduct
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-light">
        Standards and principles guiding our actions, integrity, and relationships with stakeholders.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Content Section -->
  <div class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-6 leading-snug">
          Pedoman Etika & Perilaku Perusahaan (Code of Conduct) PT Prasetia Dwidharma.
        </h2>
        
        <p class="text-gray-700 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Perusahaan juga telah menyusun standard/Pedoman Etika dan Perilaku Perusahaan, terutama dalam interaksi dengan seluruh stakeholder di Perusahaan, yang senantiasa didasarkan pada prinsip-prinsip Tata Kelola Perusahaan yang baik/ Good Corporate Governance (GCG), guna mewujudkan Visi dan Misi Perusahaan.
        </p>

        <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-8">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            Prinsip Utama Good Corporate Governance (GCG):
          </h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm text-gray-600">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">1</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-gray-900 block mb-1">Transparansi (Transparency)</strong>
                Keterbukaan dalam proses pengambilan keputusan dan pengungkapan informasi material dan relevan.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">2</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-gray-900 block mb-1">Akuntabilitas (Accountability)</strong>
                Kejelasan fungsi, pelaksanaan, dan pertanggungjawaban organ perusahaan secara efektif.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">3</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-gray-900 block mb-1">Responsibilitas (Responsibility)</strong>
                Kesesuaian pengelolaan perusahaan terhadap peraturan perundang-undangan dan prinsip korporasi yang sehat.
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">4</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-gray-900 block mb-1">Independensi & Kewajaran (Fairness)</strong>
                Pengelolaan profesional tanpa benturan kepentingan serta keadilan perlakuan bagi seluruh stakeholder.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
